        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 將關閉以完成更新"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Poki asks you before an agent pays, deletes, sends a message, places a call, types a password or does anything in Wallet: on the Live Activity, in a notification, or here in Poki. Turned off, agents do all of that without asking. Changes take effect the next time Poki opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理付款、删除、发消息、打电话、输入密码或在钱包里操作之前，Poki 会先问你，你可以在实时活动、通知或 Poki 里批准。关掉后，这些操作都不再询问。更改在下次打开 Poki 时生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理付款、刪除、發訊息、打電話、輸入密碼或在錢包裡操作之前，Poki 會先問你，你可以在實時活動、通知或 Poki 裡批准。關掉後，這些操作都不再詢問。更改在下次開啟 Poki 時生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can't reach this iPhone. Check in this order: Setup › Loopback (your proxy app or LocalDevVPN is connected, with 10.7.0.1 set), then Setup › Pairing (pair again with the loopback on), then Developer Mode in Settings → Privacy & Security." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 连不上这台 iPhone。请按顺序检查“配置 › 回环”（代理 App 或 LocalDevVPN 已连接，并已设好 10.7.0.1），然后“配置 › 配对”（在回环开着时重新配对），最后是“设置 › 隐私与安全性”里的开发者模式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 連不上這臺 iPhone。請按順序檢查「配置 › 迴環」（代理 App 或 LocalDevVPN 已連線，並已設好 10.7.0.1），然後「配置 › 配對」（在迴環開著時重新配對），最後是「設定 › 隱私與安全性」裡的開發者模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can't reach this iPhone. Turn on the loopback, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法连接此 iPhone。请开启回环后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 無法連線此 iPhone。請開啟迴環後重試。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Poki can't use the microphone. Allow it in Settings, Privacy, Microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法访问麦克风。请在“设置”›“隐私与安全性”›“麦克风”中开启权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 無法訪問麥克風。請在「設定」›「隱私與安全性」›「麥克風」中開啟許可權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki cannot access the keychain and has no relay key yet. Reinstall Poki with your signing tool, then reopen Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法访问钥匙串，因此尚无中转密钥。请使用签名工具重新安装 Poki，然后重新打开设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 無法訪問鑰匙串，因此尚無中轉金鑰。請使用簽名工具重新安裝 Poki，然後重新開啟設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can’t stay on in the background" : {
      "localizations" : {
