      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Poki keeps itself running with silent audio. Always Allow makes that sturdier, and iOS shows no location indicator for it. Poki never records your location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 通过静音音频保持运行。“始终允许”会让它更稳定，且 iOS 不会为此显示定位指示器。Poki 从不记录你的位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 透過靜音音訊保持執行。「始終允許」會讓它更穩定，且 iOS 不會為此顯示定位指示器。Poki 從不記錄你的位置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Poki keeps the key now; chatting with %@ comes in an update. Until then, choose Anthropic or OpenAI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密钥已保存。%@ 对话功能将在后续更新中推出，目前请选择 Anthropic 或 OpenAI。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "金鑰已儲存。%@ 對話功能將在後續更新中推出，目前請選擇 Anthropic 或 OpenAI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki keeps the password in this iPhone’s Keychain to sign itself again every week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 将密码保存在此 iPhone 的钥匙串中，以便每周为自己重新签名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 將密碼儲存在此 iPhone 的鑰匙串中，以便每週為自己重新簽名。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
