    "Poki needs attention" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 需要你处理"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 需要你處理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs every item ticked before an agent or the chat can use this iPhone. Items tick themselves when the phone can check them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有项目都打勾后，智能体或聊天才能使用此 iPhone。手机能检查的项目会自动打勾。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有專案都打勾後，AI 代理或聊天才能使用此 iPhone。手機能檢查的專案會自動打勾。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Poki needs the internet once after each restart of the phone to get Apple's signature for the developer disk image. Check Wi-Fi or cellular; Poki tries again by itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手机每次重启后，Poki 需要联网一次，为开发者磁盘映像获取 Apple 的签名。请检查无线局域网或蜂窝网络，Poki 会自动重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手機每次重啟後，Poki 需要聯網一次，為開發者磁碟映像獲取 Apple 的簽名。請檢查無線區域網或蜂窩網路，Poki 會自動重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs your OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 需要你批准"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 需要你批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki restarted so agents can see the screen again. It turns on when it opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已重新启动，以便智能体重新看到屏幕。打开后会自动开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
