    "Run bin/voice-bridge.mjs on your Mac and enter the address it gives. The Mac holds your OpenAI key and gives this phone a key that works for one minute, so the phone never stores it. Audio goes straight from this phone to OpenAI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 上运行 bin/voice-bridge.mjs 并输入生成的地址。OpenAI 密钥保存在 Mac 本地，手机仅获取有效期 1 分钟的临时凭证，不保存密钥，音频将由手机直连发送至 OpenAI。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 上執行 bin/voice-bridge.mjs 並輸入生成的地址。OpenAI 金鑰儲存在 Mac 本地，手機僅獲取有效期 1 分鐘的臨時憑證，不儲存金鑰，音訊將由手機直連傳送至 OpenAI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
