    "iOS asks for the passcode before UI Automation after Poki Runner was force-closed or the iPhone restarted. Enter it once; Poki carries on by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki Runner 被强制退出或 iPhone 重新启动后，iOS 会先要求输入锁屏密码，再允许 UI 自动化。只需输入一次，Poki 会自动继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki Runner 被強制關閉或 iPhone 重新啟動後，iOS 會先要求輸入鎖定畫面密碼，再允許 UI 自動化。只需輸入一次，Poki 會自動繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for the passcode to allow UI Automation after Poki restarts, or 8 hours after it was last entered. Enter it once; Poki carries on by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 重启后，或距上次输入密码超过 8 小时，iOS 会要求输入密码以允许 UI 自动化。输入一次即可，Poki 会自己继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 重新啟動後，或距上次輸入密碼超過 8 小時，iOS 會要求輸入密碼以允許 UI 自動化。輸入一次即可，Poki 會自行繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS doesn’t let Poki check this one, so turn the switch on once it’s done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 不允许 Poki 检查这一项，完成后请打开此开关。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 不允許 Poki 檢查這一項，完成後請開啟此開關。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "iOS needs a background mode to keep apps running. Poki uses lowest-accuracy location with Always Allow, which shows no location indicator, and never records your location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 需要后台模式才能让 App 保持运行。Poki 使用最低精度的定位并设为“始终允许”，这样不会显示定位指示，也绝不记录你的位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 需要後臺模式才能讓 App 保持執行。Poki 使用最低精度的定位並設為「始終允許」，這樣不會顯示定位指示，也絕不記錄你的位置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "iOS requires a background mode to keep apps running. Poki uses lowest-accuracy location and shows the location indicator while active." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 要求 App 声明特定用途才能在后台持续运行。Poki 会以最低精度使用定位服务，并在运行期间显示定位指示器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 要求 App 宣告特定用途才能在後臺持續執行。Poki 會以最低精度使用定位服務，並在執行期間顯示定位指示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while Poki’s automation session is open. Poki opens it when an agent asks and closes it when idle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅当 Poki 的自动化会话打开时，iOS 才会显示自动化横幅。Poki 会在智能体请求时打开它，并在闲置时关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅當 Poki 的自動化會話開啟時，iOS 才會顯示自動化橫幅。Poki 會在AI 代理請求時開啟它，並在閒置時關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while Poki’s automation session is open. Poki opens it when an agent asks and closes it when idle. Memory holds the routines and notes every agent shares." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在 Poki 的自动化会话打开时，iOS 才会显示自动化横幅。智能体提出请求时 Poki 打开会话，空闲时关闭。“记忆”保存所有智能体共享的例程和备忘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在 Poki 的自動化會話開啟時，iOS 才會顯示自動化橫幅。AI 代理提出請求時 Poki 開啟會話，空閒時關閉。「記憶」儲存所有AI 代理共享的例程和備忘。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while the runner is active. Poki starts it when needed and stops it when idle. Don’t close Poki Runner while an agent is working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅当 Runner 运行时，iOS 才会显示自动化横幅。Poki 会在智能体请求时启动它，并在闲置时停止。智能体工作期间请勿关闭 Poki Runner。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅當 Runner 執行時，iOS 才會顯示自動化橫幅。Poki 會在AI 代理請求時啟動它，並在閒置時停止。AI 代理工作期間請勿關閉 Poki Runner。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows this as a VPN. Enabling it may disconnect another VPN app. To keep a compatible VPN, choose External App instead." : {
